      "path": "cordis.patch.yml",
      "text": "# Suggested replies is a Web bundle. It observes completed turns, asks the\n# configured model for candidate next user messages, and projects them into the\n# official strip immediately above the message input. Clicking a candidate\n# writes the draft only; sending remains an explicit input-bar action.\n- insert:\n    - id: suggested-replies\n      name: '@anionex/dsh-suggested-replies'\n      config:\n        enabled: true\n        suggestionCount: 3\n        contextMessageCount: 4\n        maxSuggestionChars: 160\n        maxTokens: 384\n        timeoutMs: 15000\n        # Optional explicit auxiliary route. Omit to inherit the current\n        # session provider/model.\n        # suggestionProvider: deepseek-official\n        # suggestionModel: deepseek-v4-flash\n"
    }
